          "vizConfig": {
            "kind": "VizConfig",
            "group": "text",
            "version": "",
            "spec": {
              "options": {
                "mode": "markdown",
                "content": "## 15.4 - Flame graph top table\n\n1. Look at the top table in **Flame graph (TestData flame_graph)** below.\n2. Check column widths: Symbol column takes the spare width, Self and Total columns fit their values, nothing is cut off or has a horizontal scroll bar at this size.\n3. Click each column header to sort (Self, Total, Symbol), ascending and descending.\n4. Click a row. It must focus that symbol in the flame graph.\n5. Switch the theme (profile > Preferences, or `?theme=light` / `?theme=dark`) and repeat steps 2-4.\n6. Repeat in Explore: [Open flame_graph in Explore](/explore?schemaVersion=1&panes=%7B%22a1b%22%3A%7B%22datasource%22%3A%22PD8C576611E62080A%22%2C%22queries%22%3A%5B%7B%22refId%22%3A%22A%22%2C%22datasource%22%3A%7B%22type%22%3A%22grafana-testdata-datasource%22%2C%22uid%22%3A%22PD8C576611E62080A%22%7D%2C%22scenarioId%22%3A%22flame_graph%22%7D%5D%2C%22range%22%3A%7B%22from%22%3A%22now-1h%22%2C%22to%22%3A%22now%22%7D%7D%7D&orgId=1).\n\n**Expected:** column widths look right in the panel and in Explore, in light and dark themes. Sorting changes row order correctly. Clicking a row focuses (highlights/zooms) that symbol in the flame graph. No console errors.\n"
              },
              "fieldConfig": {
                "defaults": {},
                "overrides": []
              }
