              "options": {
                "mode": "markdown",
                "content": "## 15.5 - Logs table\n\nTurn on all table feature flags first. Open [LogsTable - Kitchen Sink](/d/adhjhtt).\n\n- [ ] Column **header menus** open, and their actions (sort, filter, hide/show, reorder) work.\n- [ ] **Row details** expand and collapse, and show the right fields for the row.\n- [ ] **Links** (data links / field links) in cells render and open the right target.\n- [ ] No visual or functional regressions compared with flags off (widths, scrolling, selection, copy).\n- [ ] No console errors.\n\n`logstable.spec.ts` covers the rest.\n"
              },
              "fieldConfig": {
                "defaults": {},
                "overrides": []
